### MS3 — Soumissions (Arène)
### Client HTTP IntelliJ IDEA : exécutez les requêtes dans l'ordre (1 → 6).
### La requête 1 capture l'id créé dans {{submissionId}} pour les suivantes.
### Pour passer par la gateway : remplacer @host par http://localhost:8080/ms3

@host = http://localhost:8083
@api = {{host}}/api/submissions
@challengeId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@applicantId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@submissionId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@deadline = 2030-12-31T23:59:59

### 1. Créer une soumission (brouillon) — 201
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "challengeId": "{{challengeId}}",
  "applicantId": "{{applicantId}}",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/example/arena-solution.git",
  "branch": "main"
}

> {%
client.global.set("submissionId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. Lister les soumissions du défi — 200
GET {{api}}?challengeId={{challengeId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Lister filtré par statut — 200
GET {{api}}?challengeId={{challengeId}}&status=SUBMITTED
Accept: application/json

### 3. Détail d'une soumission — 200
GET {{api}}/{{submissionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Soumettre définitivement (fige le commit) — 200, puis 409 si déjà soumise
POST {{api}}/{{submissionId}}/submit?commitSha=abc1234&deadline={{deadline}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Déposer le verdict (appel interne MS5) — 200
PUT {{api}}/{{submissionId}}/verdict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "{{submissionId}}",
  "result": "PASS",
  "passed": 8,
  "failed": 2,
  "total": 10,
  "coverage": 87.5,
  "logsUrl": "https://ci.example.com/builds/42/logs"
}

### 6. Lire le verdict — 200 (404 avant le dépôt du verdict)
GET {{api}}/{{submissionId}}/verdict
Accept: application/json

### Erreur : soumission introuvable — 404
GET {{api}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Erreur : verdict introuvable — 404
GET {{api}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/verdict
Accept: application/json

### Erreur : passed + failed ≠ total — 409
PUT {{api}}/{{submissionId}}/verdict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "{{submissionId}}",
  "result": "FAIL",
  "passed": 3,
  "failed": 3,
  "total": 10,
  "coverage": 42.0,
  "logsUrl": "https://ci.example.com/builds/43/logs"
}

### Erreur : identifiant du verdict différent de l'URL — 409
PUT {{api}}/{{submissionId}}/verdict
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "result": "PASS",
  "passed": 10,
  "failed": 0,
  "total": 10,
  "coverage": 100.0,
  "logsUrl": "https://ci.example.com/builds/44/logs"
}
